(6678362, 999010, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea.<br/> The arrangement of the glasses is not terribly convincing though, and they seem to be melting one into the other. Perhaps having the stems crossing in front of the bottle or standing but tilted slightly so to touch, as in a toast, could have worked better I like the postprocessing but I would have cloned out the dark patch in the clouds, right hand side, even if it''s probably a cloud.</td>', 'Very nice idea. The arrangement of the glasses is not terribly convincing though, and they seem to be melting one into the other. Perhaps having the stems crossing in front of the bottle or standing but tilted slightly so to touch, as in a toast, could have worked better I like the postprocessing but I would have cloned out the dark patch in the clouds, right hand side, even if it''s probably a cloud.', '2012-02-15 18:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
