(6687764, 998825, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations great shot,hope there are many more ribbons to come your way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you, Neil. I''ll give my best. DPC are unique and everyone here are highly skilful.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by :</b></div><hr/><i><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20799" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tome</a> Congrats on your first ribbon, for this magnificent shot!. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you very much, Tome. Same to you, we try our best.   <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by grahamgator:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=109227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">grahamgator</a> Congrats! My only 10; love it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you, Mary. I''ll reserve many "congrats" for you too. I believe there''ll be many coming ribbons for your excellent works.  <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nickyb:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=116575" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nickyb</a> heh, thats awesome :) congrats! </i></td></tr></table> Thanks, nickyb<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Johanna:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a> How utterly perfect. Bravo, Alessandro! Congrats on your first ribbon!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you so much, Johanna. It''s through your comments message I learn to get improve all this while. Thanks again.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=86447" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LydiaToo</a> CONGRATULATIONS on your BLUE ribbon, Alex! I''m so pleased for you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you my friend. I''m very much appreciate for your excellent constructive comments. Thank you so much, Lydia.    <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Tiny: Congratulations great shot,hope there are many more ribbons to come your way.  Thank you, Neil. I''ll give my best. DPC are unique and everyone here are highly skilful. Originally posted by : tome Congrats on your first ribbon, for this magnificent shot!.  Thank you very much, Tome. Same to you, we try our best.    Originally posted by grahamgator:  grahamgator Congrats! My only 10; love it.  Thank you, Mary. I''ll reserve many "congrats" for you too. I believe there''ll be many coming ribbons for your excellent works.   Originally posted by nickyb:  nickyb heh, thats awesome :) congrats!  Thanks, nickyb Originally posted by Johanna:  tanguera How utterly perfect. Bravo, Alessandro! Congrats on your first ribbon!!!!  Thank you so much, Johanna. It''s through your comments message I learn to get improve all this while. Thanks again. Originally posted by LydiaToo:  LydiaToo CONGRATULATIONS on your BLUE ribbon, Alex! I''m so pleased for you.  Thank you my friend. I''m very much appreciate for your excellent constructive comments. Thank you so much, Lydia.    ', '2012-02-22 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
